      "date": "2026-01-24T21:11:17.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹29.15 (vs ₹23.28 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹29.15 (up from ₹23.28 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹5.79b (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹803.0m (up 26% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (up from 12% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 20% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 40% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
